flowchart LR
    U[User] --> UI[Next.js UI]
    UI -->|upload / search / answer| API[FastAPI]

    subgraph ING[Ingestion]
      API --> VAL[Validate and hash]
      VAL --> PARSE[PDF / HTML / Markdown parser]
      PARSE --> CHUNK[Normalize and chunk with locations]
      CHUNK --> EMB[Embedding adapter]
      EMB --> PG[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    end

    subgraph RET[Retrieval and answering]
      API --> Q[Query embedding]
      Q --> DENSE[Dense search]
      API --> FTS[PostgreSQL full-text search]
      DENSE --> RRF[RRF fusion]
      FTS --> RRF
      RRF --> RERANK[Cross-encoder: top 20]
      RERANK --> ANSWER[Evidence-grounded answer]
      ANSWER --> CITE[Citation validation]
      CITE --> UI
    end

    DENSE <--> PG
    FTS <--> PG
    API <--> REDIS[(Redis cache)]
    API --> TRACE[Trace adapter]
    TRACE -. optional export .-> LF[Langfuse-compatible backend]
